{
  "id": "numerals",
  "label": "Giant Numerals",
  "engine": "html",
  "kind": "object",
  "mood": "the date as the image — the month and the day of the event set enormous, together, in the poster's own display face, captioned with the year, the weekday and the time on hairline rows, in the manner of Swiss and contemporary editorial posters. Vector, so it is razor-sharp at any size, and it changes character with the type theme (a heavy grotesque, a high-contrast serif, a brush). Reads the date from the event information; the day is never shown large on its own. Good for anything with one date to remember: concerts, openings, launches, deadlines, church and school events, sales.",
  "tone": "light",
  "type": "grotesk",
  "types": ["brutal", "fatface", "esamanru", "square", "dream", "condensed", "didone", "editorial", "impact", "swiss", "wide", "slab", "bold"],
  "requires": [
